title: Integrity Technology Group MicroScan/FishHub Delivery and Persistence Domains
id: 0279a381-c9f2-4fe0-918d-073171481568
status: experimental
description: Detects DNS queries resolving to attacker-controlled domains used by Integrity Technology Group (Flax Typhoon) for MicroScan/FishHub malware delivery and SoftEther VPN-based persistence, per joint CISA advisory AA26-281A.
references:
  - https://diesec.com/2026/10/flax-typhoon-integrity-tech-domain-seizure/
  - https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/cybersecurity-advisories/aa26-281a
author: Tia N. List
date: 2026-10-14
tags:
  - attack.command-and-control
  - attack.t1071
  - attack.t1219
logsource:
  category: dns_query
detection:
  selection:
    QueryName|endswith:
      - 'outlook3650.com'
      - 'linkedinns.net'
      - 'youtubecard.com'
      - '98aiblog.com'
  condition: selection
falsepositives:
  - Unlikely
level: high
